<%# S3a T4: the companion panel's body (assistant plan §7.7). Rendered WITHOUT
    the application layout (see AssistantPanelsController) and loaded lazily into
    the permanent shell's turbo frame the first time the panel is opened.

    The frame id is a contract with three parties: the shell arms it via
    data-src, the "Neuer Chat" link in the shell targets it, and
    assistant_chats#create UPDATES it after the first message. %>
<%= turbo_frame_tag 'assistant_panel_body', class: 'flex-1 min-h-0 flex flex-col' do %>
  <%= render 'organisations/assistant_panels/content', chat: @chat %>
<% end %>
